#: templates/core/terms.html
msgid "Law and courts"
msgstr "Ley y tribunales"

#: templates/core/terms.html
msgid ""
"Swiss law applies. If you are a consumer, you keep the protection of the "
"mandatory law of the country you live in, and you can always take a dispute "
"to the courts where you live. Otherwise the courts at the operator's place "
