#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Ramp spells and fetch lands find their lands"
msgstr "Los hechizos de rampa y las fetch lands encuentran sus tierras"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Rampant Growth, Cultivate, Wood Elves, Solemn Simulacrum and fetch lands now"
" put the land they find onto the battlefield, picking the colour your lands "
"lack. Green ramp decks reach their commander sooner."
msgstr ""
"Rampant Growth, Cultivate, Wood Elves, Solemn Simulacrum y las fetch lands "
"ahora ponen en el campo de batalla la tierra que encuentran, eligiendo el "
"color que les falta a tus tierras. Los mazos de rampa verdes juegan antes a "
"su comandante."

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Lands that enter tapped unless ..."
msgstr "Tierras que entran giradas a menos que …"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Check lands, fast and slow lands, snarls and shock lands now enter untapped "
"whenever their condition holds in the game, and shock lands pay their 2 life"
" for it."
msgstr ""
"Las check lands, fast lands, slow lands, snarls y shock lands ahora entran "
"enderezadas siempre que su condición se cumple en la partida, y las shock "
"lands pagan sus 2 vidas para ello."

