#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Temple of the False God, Urborg and Cabal Coffers"
msgstr "Temple of the False God, Urborg y Cabal Coffers"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Lands that make mana only when you control enough lands or a land type, such"
" as Temple of the False God, the Tainted lands and the Verges, now make it "
"once that holds. Urborg, Yavimaya, Crypt Ghast and Cabal Coffers now play by"
" their rules, and Path to Exile and Maze of Ith no longer need you."
msgstr ""
"Las tierras que solo producen maná si controlas suficientes tierras o un "
"tipo de tierra, como Temple of the False God, las tierras Tainted y las "
"Verges, ahora lo producen en cuanto se cumple. Urborg, Yavimaya, Crypt Ghast"
" y Cabal Coffers ahora siguen sus reglas, y Path to Exile y Maze of Ith ya "
"no te necesitan."

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "one mana of a colour your other lands could make"
msgstr "un maná de un color que tus otras tierras podrían producir"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(mana)s - assuming your opponents' lands make these colours"
msgstr ""
"%(mana)s - suponiendo que las tierras de tus oponentes producen estos "
"colores"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "makes your deck's colours, assuming your opponents' lands make them"
msgstr ""
"produce los colores de tu mazo, suponiendo que las tierras de tus oponentes "
"los producen"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Exotic Orchard and Reflecting Pool make mana"
msgstr "Exotic Orchard y Reflecting Pool producen maná"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Reflecting Pool and Incubation Druid make a colour your other lands make. "
"Exotic Orchard and Fellwar Stone make your deck's colours, assuming your "
"opponents' lands make them; the card page says so, and you can say what they"
" make at your table."
msgstr ""
"Reflecting Pool e Incubation Druid producen un color que producen tus otras "
"tierras. Exotic Orchard y Fellwar Stone producen los colores de tu mazo, "
"suponiendo que las tierras de tus oponentes los producen; la página de la "
"carta lo dice, y puedes indicar qué producen en tu mesa."

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Filter lands and Study Hall fix your colours"
msgstr "Las tierras filtro y Study Hall arreglan tus colores"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Filter lands such as Fetid Heath and Rugged Prairie turn one mana of their "
"colours into two. Study Hall, Opal Palace and Prismatic Lens turn a mana "
"into a colour you are missing when a spell needs it."
msgstr ""
"Las tierras filtro como Fetid Heath y Rugged Prairie convierten un maná de "
"sus colores en dos. Study Hall, Opal Palace y Prismatic Lens convierten un "
"maná en un color que te falta cuando un hechizo lo necesita."

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Treasure, and discarding a card to cast"
msgstr "Los Tesoros, y descartar una carta para lanzar"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Big Score, Seize the Spoils, Rapacious Dragon and the like now make their "
"Treasure, which pays for a later spell when your lands fall short. Spells "
"that ask you to discard a card to cast them discard your weakest one."
msgstr ""
"Big Score, Seize the Spoils, Rapacious Dragon y similares ahora crean sus "
"Tesoros, que pagan un hechizo posterior cuando tus tierras no alcanzan. Los "
"hechizos que piden descartar una carta para lanzarlos descartan tu carta más"
" débil."

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Faithless Looting discards, Brainstorm puts back"
msgstr "Faithless Looting descarta, Brainstorm devuelve cartas"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Spells that draw and then discard, such as Faithless Looting, Frantic Search"
" and Izzet Charm, now discard your weakest cards, and Brainstorm puts two "
"back on top. Before, they only drew. Mystic Confluence now draws three, and "
"Insatiable Avarice pays for the mode that draws."
msgstr ""
"Los hechizos que roban y luego descartan, como Faithless Looting, Frantic "
"Search e Izzet Charm, ahora descartan tus cartas más débiles, y Brainstorm "
"devuelve dos a la parte superior. Antes solo robaban. Mystic Confluence "
"ahora roba tres, e Insatiable Avarice paga el modo que roba."

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Spells with X are paid with everything left"
msgstr "Los hechizos con X se pagan con todo lo que queda"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Stroke of Genius, Blue Sun's Zenith, Walking Ballista and every other card "
"with X in its cost were cast for X = 0 and as early as possible. Now they "
"wait until nothing else can be cast and take all the mana that is left as X,"
" and draw-X spells draw that many. On a card's page you can set the smallest"
" X worth casting it for, and when you play a deck by hand the board asks you"
" for X."
msgstr ""
"Stroke of Genius, Blue Sun's Zenith, Walking Ballista y todas las demás "
"cartas con X en su coste se lanzaban con X = 0 y lo antes posible. Ahora "
"esperan hasta que no se pueda lanzar nada más y usan todo el maná que queda "
"como X, y los hechizos que roban X cartas roban esa cantidad. En la página "
"de una carta puedes fijar la X más pequeña por la que vale la pena lanzarla,"
" y cuando juegas un mazo a mano el tablero te pide la X."

#: cards/profiles.py
msgid "draws or discards by X in a way that is not modelled"
msgstr "roba o descarta según X de una forma que no está modelada"

#: cards/profiles.py
msgid "puts lands onto the battlefield by X; not modelled"
msgstr "pone tierras en el campo de batalla según X; no modelado"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "everything left once nothing else can be cast, at least %(min)s"
msgstr ""
"todo lo que queda cuando ya no se puede lanzar nada más, al menos %(min)s"

#: simulations/provenance.py
msgid "Pays X with"
msgstr "Paga X con"

#: simulations/annotations.py
msgid "Smallest X worth casting it for"
msgstr "La X más pequeña por la que lanzarla"

#: simulations/annotations.py
msgid ""
"The engine casts a spell with X last in your turn, with all the mana that is"
" left as X - but not for less than this. It starts at 1."
msgstr ""
"El motor lanza un hechizo con X el último en tu turno, con todo el maná que "
"queda como X - pero no por menos de este valor. Empieza en 1."

