#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Vampiric Tutor, Minas Tirith and the battle lands"
msgstr "Vampiric Tutor, Minas Tirith y las tierras de batalla"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Vampiric, Mystical, Enlightened and Worldly Tutor now put the card they find"
" on top of your library, where you draw it next turn. Lands that enter "
"tapped unless you control a legendary creature, a planeswalker or a basic "
"land, Starting Town and the Turbulent lands now enter untapped when that "
"holds; for the Turbulent lands we assume each opponent plays a land a turn. "
"Battle lands such as Prairie Stream entered untapped beside a single basic "
"land; now they wait for two."
msgstr ""
"Vampiric, Mystical, Enlightened y Worldly Tutor ahora ponen la carta que "
"encuentran en la parte superior de tu biblioteca, y la robas en el turno "
"siguiente. Las tierras que entran giradas a menos que controles una criatura"
" legendaria, un planeswalker o una tierra básica, Starting Town y las "
"tierras Turbulent ahora entran enderezadas cuando se cumple; para las "
"tierras Turbulent suponemos que cada oponente juega una tierra por turno. "
"Las tierras de batalla como Prairie Stream entraban enderezadas junto a una "
"sola tierra básica; ahora esperan a dos."

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(what)s on top of the library, drawn next turn"
msgstr ""
"%(what)s en la parte superior de la biblioteca, robada el turno siguiente"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"enters untapped from your fourth turn, assuming each opponent plays a land a"
" turn"
msgstr ""
"entra enderezada desde tu cuarto turno, suponiendo que cada oponente juega "
"una tierra por turno"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Wild Growth, Mirari's Wake and Cryptolith Rite"
msgstr "Wild Growth, Mirari's Wake y Cryptolith Rite"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Auras such as Wild Growth, Fertile Ground and Utopia Sprawl now add their "
"mana when the land they enchant is tapped, and Mirari's Wake, Vorinclex, "
"Kinnan, Forsaken Monument, Caged Sun, Mana Reflection and Nyxbloom Ancient "
"add theirs to what you tap. With Cryptolith Rite or Enduring Vitality your "
"creatures tap for any colour from the turn after they arrive. Bloom Tender, "
"Sanctum Weaver and Overgrown Battlement count your board, and Battle Hymn "
"and High Tide make their mana."
msgstr ""
"Las auras como Wild Growth, Fertile Ground y Utopia Sprawl ahora añaden su "
"maná cuando se gira la tierra que encantan, y Mirari's Wake, Vorinclex, "
"Kinnan, Forsaken Monument, Caged Sun, Mana Reflection y Nyxbloom Ancient "
"añaden el suyo a lo que giras. Con Cryptolith Rite o Enduring Vitality tus "
"criaturas se giran para maná de cualquier color desde el turno siguiente a "
"su llegada. Bloom Tender, Sanctum Weaver y Overgrown Battlement cuentan tu "
"campo de batalla, y Battle Hymn y High Tide producen su maná."

