#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Village Rites, Harrow, Natural Order and Ashnod's Altar"
msgstr "Village Rites, Harrow, Natural Order y Ashnod's Altar"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Spells that sacrifice, pay life or discard as an additional cost now pay it:"
" a simulated game gives up a Treasure first, then a creature that comes "
"back, then its cheapest - never your commander or a mana creature - and a "
"land only to Harrow or a search worth it. In the playtest you choose what to"
" sacrifice. Ashnod's Altar, Phyrexian Tower and Krark-Clan Ironworks "
"sacrifice when their mana lets a spell be cast, the Spirit Guides add their "
"mana from your hand, and Wight of the Reliquary and Elvish Reclaimer search "
"from the turn after they arrive. Toxic Deluge pays X = 0 life, as nothing in"
" a goldfish is there for it."
msgstr ""
"Los hechizos que sacrifican, pagan vida o descartan como coste adicional "
"ahora lo pagan: una partida simulada entrega primero un Tesoro, luego una "
"criatura que vuelve, luego su más barata – nunca tu comandante ni una "
"criatura de maná – y una tierra solo para Harrow o una búsqueda que valga la"
" pena. En el playtest eliges qué sacrificar. Ashnod's Altar, Phyrexian Tower"
" y Krark-Clan Ironworks sacrifican cuando su maná permite lanzar un hechizo,"
" los Spirit Guide añaden su maná desde tu mano, y Wight of the Reliquary y "
"Elvish Reclaimer buscan desde el turno siguiente a su llegada. Toxic Deluge "
"paga X = 0 vidas, porque en un goldfish no hay nada para él."

