#: templates/playtest/_board.html
msgid "Mana only some spells may spend"
msgstr "Maná que solo algunos hechizos pueden gastar"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Cavern of Souls, Ancient Ziggurat and Plaza of Heroes"
msgstr "Cavern of Souls, Ancient Ziggurat y Plaza of Heroes"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Lands and creatures whose mana only some spells may spend now make it in a "
"simulated game, and only those spells spend it: Ancient Ziggurat and Herd "
"Heirloom for creatures, Plaza of Heroes and Delighted Halfling for legendary"
" spells, your commander included, Eldrazi Temple and Shrine of the Forsaken "
"Gods for colourless ones, Power Depot for artifacts, Haven of the Spirit "
"Dragon for Dragons. Cavern of Souls and Unclaimed Territory name your deck's"
" most common creature type - your deck page says which, beside the card, and"
" you can name another. The playtest shows such mana apart from the rest."
msgstr ""
"Las tierras y criaturas cuyo maná solo pueden gastar algunos hechizos ahora "
"lo producen en una partida simulada, y solo esos hechizos lo gastan: Ancient"
" Ziggurat y Herd Heirloom para criaturas, Plaza of Heroes y Delighted "
"Halfling para hechizos legendarios, tu comandante incluido, Eldrazi Temple y"
" Shrine of the Forsaken Gods para los incoloros, Power Depot para "
"artefactos, Haven of the Spirit Dragon para Dragones. Cavern of Souls y "
"Unclaimed Territory nombran el tipo de criatura más común de tu mazo - la "
"página de tu mazo dice cuál, junto a la carta, y puedes nombrar otro. El "
"playtest muestra ese maná aparte del resto."

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Heraldic Banner, Three Tree City and Fanatic of Rhonas"
msgstr "Heraldic Banner, Three Tree City y Fanatic of Rhonas"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"More mana cards now work in a simulated game. Relic of Sauron, Gwenna and "
"Smokebraider make their mana in any combination of colours. Heraldic Banner,"
" Valgavoth's Lair and Throne of Eldraine make the colour your deck's costs "
"ask for most - your deck page says which, beside the card, and you can "
"choose another. Three Tree City counts your deck's most common creature "
"type. Fanatic of Rhonas, Whisperer of the Wilds and Ilysian Caryatid make "
"more once you control a creature with power 4 or greater, and Nimbus Maze, "
"Rite of Flame and Cabal Ritual's threshold work too. Cards with hybrid mana "
"symbols are no longer flagged: the engine has paid them correctly for a "
"while."
msgstr ""
"Más cartas de maná funcionan ahora en una partida simulada. Relic of Sauron,"
" Gwenna y Smokebraider generan su maná en cualquier combinación de colores. "
"Heraldic Banner, Valgavoth's Lair y Throne of Eldraine generan el color que "
"más piden los costes de tu mazo: la página de tu mazo dice cuál, junto a la "
"carta, y puedes elegir otro. Three Tree City cuenta el tipo de criatura más "
"común de tu mazo. Fanatic of Rhonas, Whisperer of the Wilds e Ilysian "
"Caryatid generan más en cuanto controlas una criatura con fuerza 4 o más, y "
"Nimbus Maze, Rite of Flame y el umbral de Cabal Ritual también funcionan. "
"Las cartas con símbolos de maná híbrido ya no se marcan: el motor las paga "
"correctamente desde hace tiempo."

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "monocoloured %(color)s"
msgstr "monocolor %(color)s"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "a creature with power %(count)s or greater"
msgstr "una criatura con fuerza %(count)s o más"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"chooses a colour, but no card in this deck has a coloured cost: it is played"
" as a choice of its colours"
msgstr ""
"elige un color, pero ninguna carta de este mazo tiene un coste de color: se "
"juega como una elección entre sus colores"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid ""
"chooses %(color)s, the colour most mana symbols in this deck's costs ask for"
" (%(count)s)"
msgstr ""
"elige %(color)s, el color que piden más símbolos de maná en los costes de "
"este mazo (%(count)s)"

#: simulations/annotations.py
msgid "Colour it chooses"
msgstr "Color que elige"

#: simulations/annotations.py
msgid ""
"For Heraldic Banner, Throne of Eldraine and the like: the colour you choose "
"as it enters. Left empty, the engine chooses the colour most mana symbols in"
" your deck's costs ask for."
msgstr ""
"Para Heraldic Banner, Throne of Eldraine y similares: el color que eliges "
"cuando entra. Si lo dejas vacío, el motor elige el color que piden más "
"símbolos de maná en los costes de tu mazo."

#: simulations/forms.py
msgid "The deck's most common colour"
msgstr "El color más común del mazo"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Springleaf Drum, Relic of Legends, Urza and the Moxen"
msgstr "Springleaf Drum, Relic of Legends, Urza y los Mox"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Cards that tap another of your permanents for mana now make it in a "
"simulated game: Springleaf Drum, Survivors' Encampment and Holdout "
"Settlement tap a creature, Relic of Legends each legendary creature - your "
"commander included - Urza, Lord High Artificer each artifact and his "
"Construct, Grand Architect each blue creature. Only a permanent that makes "
"no mana of its own is tapped. Mox Diamond is cast when a land card is left "
"in hand after your land drop and discards it, Chrome Mox exiles the most "
"expensive coloured card in hand and makes its colours, and Millikin mills a "
"card each time it taps. Your deck page says all of this beside each card."
msgstr ""
"Las cartas que giran otro de tus permanentes para generar maná ahora lo "
"generan en una partida simulada: Springleaf Drum, Survivors' Encampment y "
"Holdout Settlement giran una criatura, Relic of Legends cada criatura "
"legendaria - tu comandante incluido -, Urza, Lord High Artificer cada "
"artefacto y su Constructo, Grand Architect cada criatura azul. Solo se gira "
"un permanente que no genera maná por sí mismo. Mox Diamond se lanza cuando "
"te queda una carta de tierra en la mano después de tu tierra del turno, y la"
" descarta; Chrome Mox exilia la carta de color más cara de tu mano y genera "
"sus colores; Millikin muele una carta cada vez que se gira. La página de tu "
"mazo dice todo esto junto a cada carta."

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "an untapped permanent to tap for it"
msgstr "un permanente enderezado que girar para ello"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "an untapped artifact or creature to tap for it"
msgstr "un artefacto o una criatura enderezados que girar para ello"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "an untapped artifact to tap for it"
msgstr "un artefacto enderezado que girar para ello"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "an untapped legendary creature to tap for it"
msgstr "una criatura legendaria enderezada que girar para ello"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "an untapped creature to tap for it"
msgstr "una criatura enderezada que girar para ello"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps a creature of yours that makes no mana and is not used otherwise this "
"turn: the engine plays no combat, so tapping it costs nothing"
msgstr ""
"gira una de tus criaturas que no genera maná y no se usa de otro modo este "
"turno: el motor no juega combates, así que girarla no cuesta nada"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps a legendary creature of yours that makes no mana and is not used "
"otherwise this turn: the engine plays no combat, so tapping it costs nothing"
msgstr ""
"gira una de tus criaturas legendarias que no genera maná y no se usa de otro"
" modo este turno: el motor no juega combates, así que girarla no cuesta nada"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps a permanent of yours that makes no mana and is not used otherwise this "
"turn - never a land"
msgstr ""
"gira uno de tus permanentes que no genera maná y no se usa de otro modo este"
" turno - nunca una tierra"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps an artifact or creature of yours that makes no mana and is not used "
"otherwise this turn: the engine plays no combat, so tapping it costs nothing"
msgstr ""
"gira uno de tus artefactos o una de tus criaturas que no genera maná y no se"
" usa de otro modo este turno: el motor no juega combates, así que girarlo no"
" cuesta nada"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps each legendary creature of yours that makes no mana, your commander "
"included, for one mana each: the engine plays no combat, so tapping them "
"costs nothing"
msgstr ""
"gira cada una de tus criaturas legendarias que no genera maná, tu comandante"
" incluido, por un maná cada una: el motor no juega combates, así que "
"girarlas no cuesta nada"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps each artifact of yours that makes no mana, for its mana; a Treasure is "
"sacrificed for its own mana instead"
msgstr ""
"gira cada uno de tus artefactos que no genera maná, para su maná; un Tesoro "
"se sacrifica en cambio por su propio maná"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps each creature of yours of the kind it names that makes no mana, itself "
"included when it is one: the engine plays no combat, so tapping them costs "
"nothing"
msgstr ""
"gira cada una de tus criaturas del tipo que nombra que no genera maná, ella "
"misma incluida si lo es: el motor no juega combates, así que girarlas no "
"cuesta nada"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps each permanent of yours that makes no mana, for its mana - never a land"
msgstr ""
"gira cada uno de tus permanentes que no genera maná, para su maná - nunca "
"una tierra"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "taps the artifact token it makes as it enters too"
msgstr "gira también la ficha de artefacto que crea al entrar"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"is cast only with a land card left in hand after the turn's land drop, and "
"discards it - one that would enter tapped first"
msgstr ""
"solo se lanza con una carta de tierra que quede en la mano después de la "
"tierra del turno, y la descarta - primero una que entraría girada"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"is cast only with a coloured nonartifact, nonland card in hand; it exiles "
"the most expensive one, the card a discard would take, and makes its colours"
msgstr ""
"solo se lanza con una carta de color que no sea artefacto ni tierra en la "
"mano; exilia la más cara, la que se llevaría un descarte, y genera sus "
"colores"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "is tapped for mana every turn, and mills a card each time"
msgstr "se gira para generar maná cada turno, y muele una carta cada vez"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"keeps its counters as mana and spends them only when a spell needs them, as "
"a Treasure is spent"
msgstr ""
"guarda sus contadores como maná y solo los gasta cuando un hechizo los "
"necesita, como un Tesoro"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"spends a counter each turn it is tapped for this mana, whether or not that "
"colour is needed; with none left it makes only its other mana, if it has any"
msgstr ""
"gasta un contador cada turno en que se gira para este maná, se necesite o no"
" ese color; sin contadores solo genera su otro maná, si tiene"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"enters with X counters, X being all the mana left when it is cast, last in "
"the main phase"
msgstr ""
"entra con X contadores, siendo X todo el maná que queda cuando se lanza, en "
"último lugar en la fase principal"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"is kicked as often as the mana left pays for, at least once - cast last in "
"the main phase, as a spell with X is"
msgstr ""
"se estimula tantas veces como paga el maná restante, al menos una vez - "
"lanzado en último lugar en la fase principal, como un hechizo con X"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"enters with a counter for each colour the open mana can make when it is "
"cast, at most one for each mana it costs"
msgstr ""
"entra con un contador por cada color que el maná disponible puede generar "
"cuando se lanza, como máximo uno por cada maná que cuesta"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"taps each turn from the turn after it enters to put one more counter on "
"itself"
msgstr ""
"se gira cada turno, a partir del turno siguiente a su entrada, para ponerse "
"un contador más"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"puts a counter on itself each time it is tapped, so it makes one more mana "
"each turn"
msgstr ""
"se pone un contador cada vez que se gira, así que genera un maná más cada "
"turno"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"gets a counter for each red spell you cast and turns each three into "
"{R}{R}{R} at once, kept as a Treasure is until a spell needs it"
msgstr ""
"recibe un contador por cada hechizo rojo que lanzas y convierte enseguida "
"cada tres en {R}{R}{R}, que se guarda como un Tesoro hasta que un hechizo lo"
" necesita"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "is sacrificed as your next turn begins once its last counter is gone"
msgstr ""
"se sacrifica al comienzo de tu siguiente turno una vez que se ha ido su "
"último contador"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"makes its mana once for each point of toughness, then dies as your next turn"
" begins"
msgstr ""
"genera su maná una vez por cada punto de resistencia y luego muere al "
"comienzo de tu siguiente turno"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"returns to your hand as your next turn begins once its last counter is gone,"
" and may be cast again"
msgstr ""
"vuelve a tu mano al comienzo de tu siguiente turno una vez que se ha ido su "
"último contador, y puede lanzarse de nuevo"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"spends one energy each turn it is tapped for any colour, whether or not that"
" colour is needed; energy comes only from cards that give it as they enter, "
"and without it the card makes only its other mana, if it has any"
msgstr ""
"gasta una energía cada turno en que se gira para un color cualquiera, se "
"necesite o no ese color; la energía solo viene de las cartas que la dan al "
"entrar, y sin ella la carta solo genera su otro maná, si tiene"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "is used once each turn from the turn after it enters, as if it tapped"
msgstr ""
"se usa una vez por turno a partir del turno siguiente a su entrada, como si "
"se girara"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"puts the counters it enters with on itself - on another creature it would "
"make no mana"
msgstr ""
"se pone a sí misma los contadores con los que entra - en otra criatura no "
"generaría maná"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"makes all its mana in one colour: the one the cards in hand ask for most"
msgstr ""
"genera todo su maná de un solo color: el que más piden las cartas de la mano"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"sacrifices the Food it makes as it enters for one mana, once; it never pays "
"{1}{G} for another Food, which costs more than it gives"
msgstr ""
"sacrifica una vez la Comida que crea al entrar por un maná; nunca paga "
"{1}{G} por otra Comida, que cuesta más de lo que da"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Everflowing Chalice, Pentad Prism, energy and storage lands"
msgstr ""
"Everflowing Chalice, Pentad Prism, la energía y las tierras de "
"almacenamiento"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Cards that keep their mana as counters, energy or a Food now make it in a "
"simulated game. Pentad Prism and Crystalline Crawler spend their counters "
"only when a spell needs them, as a Treasure; Runaway Steam-Kin turns three "
"counters into three red mana. Vivid lands, storage lands, Gemstone Mine, "
"Aether Hub, Servant of the Conduit, Channeler Initiate, Wall of Roots, Mana "
"Bloom and Gilded Goose use one each turn they tap. Everflowing Chalice is "
"kicked like a spell with X, and it, Astral Cornucopia and Empowered "
"Autogenerator make one mana for each counter. Your deck page says all of "
"this beside each card."
msgstr ""
"Las cartas que guardan su maná como contadores, energía o una Comida ahora "
"lo generan en una partida simulada. Pentad Prism y Crystalline Crawler solo "
"gastan sus contadores cuando un hechizo los necesita, como un Tesoro; "
"Runaway Steam-Kin convierte tres contadores en tres manás rojos. Las tierras"
" Vivid, las tierras de almacenamiento, Gemstone Mine, Aether Hub, Servant of"
" the Conduit, Channeler Initiate, Wall of Roots, Mana Bloom y Gilded Goose "
"usan uno cada turno en que se giran. Everflowing Chalice se estimula como un"
" hechizo con X, y él, Astral Cornucopia y Empowered Autogenerator generan un"
" maná por cada contador. La página de tu mazo dice todo esto junto a cada "
"carta."

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(color)s equal to its power"
msgstr "%(color)s igual a su fuerza"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(color)s equal to the greatest power among your creatures"
msgstr "%(color)s igual a la mayor fuerza entre tus criaturas"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "%(color)s equal to the greatest toughness among your other creatures"
msgstr "%(color)s igual a la mayor resistencia entre tus otras criaturas"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "one %(color)s for each +1/+1 counter on it"
msgstr "un %(color)s por cada contador +1/+1 sobre ella"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"counts its power as the turn's mana is opened: the power printed on it and "
"its +1/+1 counters, no pumps or anthems; counters it gets later in the turn "
"count from the next turn"
msgstr ""
"cuenta su fuerza cuando se abre el maná del turno: la fuerza impresa y sus "
"contadores +1/+1, sin potenciadores ni anthems; los contadores que recibe "
"más tarde en el turno cuentan desde el turno siguiente"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"counts the greatest power among your creatures as the turn's mana is opened:"
" printed power and +1/+1 counters, no pumps or anthems"
msgstr ""
"cuenta la mayor fuerza entre tus criaturas cuando se abre el maná del turno:"
" fuerza impresa y contadores +1/+1, sin potenciadores ni anthems"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"counts the greatest toughness among your other creatures as the turn's mana "
"is opened: printed toughness and +1/+1 counters, no pumps or anthems"
msgstr ""
"cuenta la mayor resistencia entre tus otras criaturas cuando se abre el maná"
" del turno: resistencia impresa y contadores +1/+1, sin potenciadores ni "
"anthems"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"counts its +1/+1 counters as the turn's mana is opened; counters it gets "
"later in the turn count from the next turn"
msgstr ""
"cuenta sus contadores +1/+1 cuando se abre el maná del turno; los contadores"
" que recibe más tarde en el turno cuentan desde el turno siguiente"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"gets a +1/+1 counter for each noncreature spell you cast; the damage to the "
"opponents is not counted"
msgstr ""
"recibe un contador +1/+1 por cada hechizo que no sea de criatura que lances;"
" el daño a los oponentes no se cuenta"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"evolves when a creature enters with greater printed power or toughness plus "
"counters than it has"
msgstr ""
"evoluciona cuando entra una criatura con mayor fuerza o resistencia impresa "
"más contadores que la suya"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"gets a counter from Increment when a spell's mana value is greater than its "
"power or toughness; X is not counted"
msgstr ""
"recibe un contador de Increment cuando el valor de maná de un hechizo es "
"mayor que su fuerza o su resistencia; X no se cuenta"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "as much %(color)s as your devotion to it"
msgstr "tanto %(color)s como tu devoción a ese color"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "mana of one colour"
msgstr "maná de un solo color"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid "pays the coloured mana its ability costs with any mana, as generic"
msgstr ""
"paga el maná de color que cuesta su habilidad con cualquier maná, como "
"genérico"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"gives its {T}: Add {G} only to creatures with a +1/+1 counter; other kinds "
"of counters are not counted"
msgstr ""
"da su {T}: Add {G} solo a las criaturas con un contador +1/+1; otros tipos "
"de contadores no se cuentan"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"turns into its land at your end step once you control enough creatures, and "
"makes mana from your next turn on; it never counts as a land drop"
msgstr ""
"se transforma en su tierra en tu paso final en cuanto controlas suficientes "
"criaturas, y produce maná desde tu siguiente turno; nunca cuenta como tierra"
" jugada"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
#, python-format
msgid "your creatures with a counter tap for %(mana)s"
msgstr "tus criaturas con un contador se giran por %(mana)s"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"puts its counters as it enters on the creatures they make the most mana with"
" - Incubation Druid first, then creatures without a mana ability - and on "
"creatures that were there before this turn rather than new ones"
msgstr ""
"pone sus contadores al entrar en las criaturas con las que producen más maná"
" - primero Incubation Druid, luego criaturas sin habilidad de maná - y en "
"criaturas que ya estaban antes de este turno en lugar de las nuevas"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"adapts as soon as the mana left after the turn's spells and land searches "
"pays for it, before a spell with X takes the rest"
msgstr ""
"se adapta en cuanto el maná que queda tras los hechizos y búsquedas de "
"tierras del turno alcanza para pagarla, antes de que un hechizo con X se "
"lleve el resto"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"adds one more counter each time the engine puts +1/+1 counters on one of "
"your creatures"
msgstr ""
"añade un contador más cada vez que el motor pone contadores +1/+1 sobre una "
"de tus criaturas"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"draws a card when one of your creatures enters with more power than each "
"other creature; a goldfish's opponents have no creatures"
msgstr ""
"roba una carta cuando una de tus criaturas entra con más fuerza que cada "
"otra criatura; los oponentes de un goldfish no tienen criaturas"

#: simulations/engine/adapter.py
msgid ""
"takes the creature of highest mana value among the cards it looks at, and "
"puts the rest on the bottom"
msgstr ""
"toma la criatura de mayor valor de maná entre las cartas que mira, y pone el"
" resto en el fondo"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Selvala, Marwyn, Rishkar and mana by power"
msgstr "Selvala, Marwyn, Rishkar y el maná según la fuerza"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Creatures whose mana counts power or +1/+1 counters now make it in a "
"simulated game. A creature's power is the power printed on it plus its +1/+1"
" counters, no pumps or anthems: Kami of Whispered Hopes, Marwyn and Vivi "
"Ornitier tap for their own, Selvala for the greatest, Arbor Adherent for the"
" greatest toughness of the others, Gyre Sage for its counters. The counters "
"come from creatures that enter with them, Rishkar, Evolve, Increment, Adapt "
"- Incubation Druid makes three - and every other Elf that enters, and Kami "
"adds one more each time. Growing Rites of Itlimoc finds a creature and turns"
" into its land at four creatures. Your deck page says all of this beside "
"each card."
msgstr ""
"Las criaturas cuyo maná cuenta la fuerza o los contadores +1/+1 ahora lo "
"producen en una partida simulada. La fuerza de una criatura es la fuerza "
"impresa más sus contadores +1/+1, sin potenciadores ni anthems: Kami of "
"Whispered Hopes, Marwyn y Vivi Ornitier se giran por la suya, Selvala por la"
" mayor, Arbor Adherent por la mayor resistencia de las demás, Gyre Sage por "
"sus contadores. Los contadores vienen de criaturas que entran con ellos, de "
"Rishkar, Evolve, Increment, Adapt - Incubation Druid produce tres - y de "
"cada otro Elfo que entra, y Kami añade uno más cada vez. Growing Rites of "
"Itlimoc encuentra una criatura y se transforma en su tierra con cuatro "
"criaturas. La página de tu mazo explica todo esto junto a cada carta."

