#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Sword of the Animist, Goldspan Dragon, Ragavan and combat"
msgstr "Sword of the Animist, Goldspan Dragon, Ragavan y el combate"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"A simulated game now has a combat. Every creature that can attack does, each"
" turn, and - a goldfish has no blockers - deals its damage to a player; "
"against opponents with many blockers that is optimistic, and your deck page "
"says so beside each card it matters for. Sword of the Animist, Bitterthorn "
"and Kodama of the West Tree find lands; Goldspan Dragon, whose Treasures "
"then make two mana, Captain Lannery Storm, Ragavan, Professional Face-"
"Breaker, Grim Hireling, Diamond Pick-Axe, Shiny Impetus, Sticky Fingers and "
"Curse of Opulence make Treasure. Savage Ventmaw's mana is spent in a second "
"main phase, where a spell with X waits for it. Equipment is equipped with "
"mana left over, Paradise Mantle turns a creature into a mana creature, and "
"the playtest has an Equip button."
msgstr ""
"Una partida simulada ahora tiene combate. Cada criatura que puede atacar lo "
"hace, cada turno, y - un goldfish no tiene bloqueadores - hace su daño a un "
"jugador; contra oponentes con muchos bloqueadores eso es optimista, y la "
"página de tu mazo lo dice junto a cada carta a la que afecta. Sword of the "
"Animist, Bitterthorn y Kodama of the West Tree encuentran tierras; Goldspan "
"Dragon, cuyos Tesoros generan entonces dos manás, Captain Lannery Storm, "
"Ragavan, Professional Face-Breaker, Grim Hireling, Diamond Pick-Axe, Shiny "
"Impetus, Sticky Fingers y Curse of Opulence crean Tesoros. El maná de Savage"
" Ventmaw se gasta en una segunda fase principal, donde un hechizo con X lo "
"espera. Los Equipos se equipan con el maná que sobra, Paradise Mantle "
"convierte una criatura en una criatura de maná, y el playtest tiene un botón"
" Equipar."

