#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Archdruid's Charm, Gifts Ungiven, Tempt with Discovery and other searches"
msgstr ""
"Archdruid's Charm, Gifts Ungiven, Tempt with Discovery y otras búsquedas"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"More searches now work in a simulated game. Open the Armory, Solve the "
"Equation, Spellseeker and Ranger-Captain of Eos find the kind of card they "
"name, Demonic Counsel any card once your graveyard holds four card types, "
"Gamble discards at random. Archdruid's Charm finds a land while your hand "
"has none, a creature otherwise; Gifts Ungiven leaves you the two cards an "
"opponent would give you; Defense of the Heart fires from your fourth turn. "
"Traverse the Outlands, Entish Restoration, Circuitous Route, Claim Jumper, "
"Keeper of the Accord, Open the Way and Sword of Hearth and Home find lands, "
"and Tempt with Discovery finds two, assuming one opponent takes the offer. "
"Cycle of Renewal and Roiling Regrowth now sacrifice their land, as printed. "
"Neheb, the Eternal adds {R} for the combat damage, Crime Novelist for each "
"Treasure you spend. Your deck page states every assumption beside the card."
msgstr ""
"Más búsquedas funcionan ahora en una partida simulada. Open the Armory, "
"Solve the Equation, Spellseeker y Ranger-Captain of Eos encuentran el tipo "
"de carta que nombran, Demonic Counsel cualquier carta en cuanto tu "
"cementerio tiene cuatro tipos de carta, Gamble descarta al azar. Archdruid's"
" Charm encuentra una tierra mientras tu mano no tiene ninguna, una criatura "
"si no; Gifts Ungiven te deja las dos cartas que te daría un oponente; "
"Defense of the Heart se dispara a partir de tu cuarto turno. Traverse the "
"Outlands, Entish Restoration, Circuitous Route, Claim Jumper, Keeper of the "
"Accord, Open the Way y Sword of Hearth and Home encuentran tierras, y Tempt "
"with Discovery encuentra dos, suponiendo que un oponente acepta la oferta. "
"Cycle of Renewal y Roiling Regrowth ahora sacrifican su tierra, como está "
"impreso. Neheb, the Eternal agrega {R} por el daño de combate, Crime "
"Novelist por cada Tesoro que gastas. La página de tu mazo indica cada "
"suposición junto a la carta."

