msgstr "Vacío o 1: uno."

#: cards/forge_merge.py
msgid "draws cards in a way that is not read yet"
msgstr "roba cartas de una forma que aún no se lee"

#: cards/forge_merge.py
msgid "makes Treasure in a way that is not read yet"
msgstr "crea Tesoros de una forma que aún no se lee"

#: cards/forge_merge.py
msgid "searches for lands in a way that is not read yet"
msgstr "busca tierras de una forma que aún no se lee"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid "Cards that draw as they enter, and no free cards from Cycling"
msgstr "Cartas que roban al entrar, y ninguna carta gratis por Ciclo"

#: changelog/entries.py
msgid ""
"Where our reading of a card's text left something out, the simulation now "
"also reads the card from Forge's card scripts: creatures and artifacts that "
"draw as they enter, such as Baleful Strix and Mulldrifter; lands that enter "
"tapped, such as Boseiju, or unless you reveal an Elf, as Gilt-Leaf Palace; "
"Treasure, land searches and mana abilities. A spell no longer draws a card "
"for the Cycling, Clue, Learn or gift written on it, which was a free card "
"every time it was cast, and Phyrexian Tribute sacrifices its two creatures. "
"A card that draws or makes Treasure in a way the simulation does not read "
"yet is now marked, so that you can correct it."
msgstr ""
"Donde nuestra lectura del texto de una carta omitía algo, la simulación "
"ahora también lee la carta de los scripts de cartas de Forge: criaturas y "
"artefactos que roban al entrar, como Baleful Strix y Mulldrifter; tierras "
"que entran giradas, como Boseiju, o a menos que muestres un Elfo, como Gilt-"
"Leaf Palace; Tesoros, búsquedas de tierras y habilidades de maná. Un hechizo"
" ya no roba una carta por el Ciclo, la Pista, Aprender o el regalo que lleva"
" escrito, que era una carta gratis cada vez que se lanzaba, y Phyrexian "
"Tribute sacrifica sus dos criaturas. Una carta que roba o crea Tesoros de "
"una forma que la simulación aún no lee ahora está marcada, para que puedas "
"corregirla."

